# 后台温度采样、关闭监测冻结并撤消期限、重新开启重设采样起点
0 expect temp 23.0
0 expect monitoring on
0 expect wakeup at:1000

1000 advance
1000 expect temp 23.1
1000 expect wakeup at:2000

2500 advance
2500 expect temp 23.2
2500 expect wakeup at:3000

# 导航至“实时监测”并关闭
2510 next
2510 next
2510 next
2510 expect focus monitor
2520 activate
2520 expect monitoring off
# 2520 启动了 160ms 开关动画（每 16ms 采样），到 2680ms 动画结束
2700 advance
2700 expect wakeup on_event

# 经过很久也不再更新温度
8000 advance
8000 expect temp 23.2
8000 expect wakeup on_event

# 重新开启监测，重设采样起点到 8100 -> 下一期限 9100
8100 activate
8100 expect monitoring on
8300 advance
8300 expect temp 23.2
8300 expect wakeup at:9100
9100 advance
9100 expect temp 23.1
